version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-10-17
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/wenhaozhang0066/SlideTwin"
url: "https://wenhaozhang0066.github.io/SlideTwin/"
abstract: >-
  SlideTwin simulates reading a whole-slide image through a microscope-like viewer: preset
  magnifications, a fixed field of view, action costs in virtual time, protocol rules and a
  replayable log. People use it in a web UI; agents use the same sessions through REST, MCP or an
  in-process training interface.
keywords:
  - digital pathology
  - whole-slide images
  - agents
  - simulator
  - MCP
